===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{m|non|døkkr}}, {{m|non|dǫkkr}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{m|gem-pro|*dankwaz}}.
Cognates include Faroese {{m|fo|døkkur}} and German {{m|de|dunkel}}.

